{"kind":"issue","data":{"id":2,"uid":"01KR02XWEX5N4W5CYQ4PBSV606","project_id":1,"number":2,"title":"MINDEF BSEP POC Reschedule","body":"Follow-up engagement with MINDEF (BSEP, MOSEP, 91 RSD) after April technical visit to NTT Data Center.\n\n**Success Criteria:**\n- Reschedule follow-up meeting (target: May 10-15, 2026)\n- Deliver live pentest-ai-agents swarm demo\n- Define POC scope (RM 200K-300K, 30-day)\n\n**Stakeholders:** Lt Kol Rajeswari, Mej Aminul Habibi, Lt Kol Wan Hariati, Lt Kol Md Rizan\n\n**Blocker:** Awaiting Zaharudin (CSM) reintroduction pathway\n\n**Original Visit:** 2026-04-22, 28 personnel attended","status":"open","closed_reason":null,"owner":null,"author":"second-agent","created_at":"2026-05-07T02:05:37.117Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T02:05:37.117Z","closed_at":null,"deleted_at":null}}
{"kind":"issue","data":{"id":3,"uid":"01KR02XZ4VS195A9RS4GQ4E1XJ","project_id":1,"number":3,"title":"ChainSentry Validation Layer Integration","body":"Integrate pentest-ai-agents (exploit-chainer, poc-validator) into ChainSentry platform for automated validation.\n\n**Success Criteria:**\n- Document exploit-chainer integration architecture\n- Implement poc-validator as ChainSentry ingestion source\n- Demo: End-to-end vulnerability → exploit chain → PoC validation\n\n**Dependencies:**\n- pentest-ai-agents repository (ahmadfaurani/pentest-ai-agents, v3.1)\n- AIL Framework correlation layer\n\n**Strategic Value:** Sovereign cognitive red team positioning for GovSec POC","status":"open","closed_reason":null,"owner":null,"author":"second-agent","created_at":"2026-05-07T02:05:39.867Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T02:05:51.787Z","closed_at":null,"deleted_at":null}}
{"kind":"issue","data":{"id":4,"uid":"01KR02Y1W4NP55PAM9T8Y5TP8C","project_id":1,"number":4,"title":"CBO-01 GovSec Executive GTM Deck Update","body":"Update GovSec POC Executive GTM deck with FAMA + pentest-ai-agents + DeepSec integration capabilities.\n\n**Success Criteria:**\n- Integrate FAMA failure-aware orchestration narrative\n- Add pentest-ai-agents sovereign red team positioning\n- Include DeepSec code scanning differentiation\n- Deck ready for CSM stakeholder meetings\n\n**Current Status:** Deck complete (Apr 26), pending capability updates\n\n**Target Audience:** CSM DG → CIO → CISO cascade","status":"open","closed_reason":null,"owner":null,"author":"second-agent","created_at":"2026-05-07T02:05:42.660Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T02:05:42.660Z","closed_at":null,"deleted_at":null}}
{"kind":"issue","data":{"id":5,"uid":"01KR02Y56FP5M8MRF74SW5G2JH","project_id":1,"number":5,"title":"OpenClaw Event Loop Stabilization","body":"Remediate event loop delays (P99 \u003e50ms, max spikes \u003e10s) in OpenClaw Gateway to ensure reliable engagement delivery.\n\n**Success Criteria:**\n- P99 Event Loop Delay \u003c50ms (sustained)\n- Max Event Loop Delay \u003c5s (no spikes \u003e10s)\n- Zero fetch-timeout errors in 24h window\n- 100% Telegram message delivery confirmation\n\n**Root Cause:** Fetch timeouts blocking Node.js event loop\n\n**Remediation Plan:**\n- Phase 1: Timeout config + Node.js optimization (COMPLETE)\n- Phase 2: 24h monitoring baseline (IN PROGRESS)\n- Phase 3: Circuit breaker + request queuing (PENDING)\n\n**Impact:** Telegram connectivity, agent response time, demo reliability","status":"open","closed_reason":null,"owner":null,"author":"second-agent","created_at":"2026-05-07T02:05:46.063Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T02:05:46.063Z","closed_at":null,"deleted_at":null}}
